---
import ArticleLayout from '../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
---

<ArticleLayout
	title="Articles — Semantic Signal LLM Trader"
	description="Technical articles about the Semantic Signal LLM trading bot: chart vision, vector memory, and the executor separation."
	meta="Articles · August 2026"
>
	<span slot="title">Articles</span>
	<p slot="subtitle" class="subtitle">Deep dives into how the system actually works — written by the developer, grounded in the code.</p>

	<section class="section">
		<h2>Latest</h2>

		<div class="article-card">
			<h3><a href="/articles/chart-vision">How the Bot Reads Charts: From Candles to Conviction</a></h3>
			<p>The full pipeline from raw market data to a reasoned trading decision — 999 candles, 50+ Numba indicators, a 1080p chart image, and an LLM that has to defend its call.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="article-card">
			<h3><a href="/articles/vector-memory">Vector Memory: How an LLM Trader Remembers Its Mistakes</a></h3>
			<p>Every closed trade becomes a 768-dimensional vector in ChromaDB. Before each decision, the bot reviews its own history — and a math check separates luck from skill.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="article-card">
			<h3><a href="/articles/executor-separation">From Paper to Real Money: Why the Executor Is a Separate Service</a></h3>
			<p>Reasoning and order execution are deliberately decoupled. Why that matters for safety, and how the system is being carried from simulated capital to live exchange orders.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="article-card">
			<h3><a href="/story">The Full 7-Month Development Story</a></h3>
			<p>The complete engineering journey — from stateless prompt experiments in a Wrocław warehouse to a 1,270-test cognitive trading engine.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="cta-box">
		<p>See the system in action: the live dashboard streams every decision, prompt, and reasoning step in real time.</p>
		<a href="https://semanticsignal.qrak.org" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">📊 Live Dashboard</a>
		<a href="https://github.com/qrak/LLM_trader" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">🐙 GitHub Repository</a>
	</div>
</ArticleLayout>

<style>
	.article-card {
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.article-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		border-color: var(--border-accent);
	}

	.article-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}

	.article-card h3 a {
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.article-card h3 a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-emerald);
	}

	.article-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
	}
</style>
